  "notes": "Official Liebherr brochure datasheet (not the full load chart book). 10 of 15 boom lengths selected; omitted: 39, 48.7, 58.5, 68.2, 77.2 m. The 300 t rating (3 m, 14.7 m boom) is ONLY over the rear (sub-column '*' on the source page; over-rear values 300/183/173.5/... not stored); 360° values come from the other 14.7 m sub-column (max 135.5 t). Remark 10: capacities above 135.5 t / 186 t require additional pulley block/special equipment. Remark 5: hook block/hook weight is part of the load and must be deducted (chartIncludesHookBlock=true means tabulated value includes hook block weight). Chart header icon shows outriggers without a stated dimension; 8.9 x 8.5 m full base per VarioBase illustration p.12 and dimension drawing p.3 (8916 / 8932 mm longitudinal, 8532 mm transverse) - assumed full outrigger base. maxHookHeight_m 114 is the brochure-cover max hoist height (with jib), not telescopic boom only. maxOutriggerForce_t 138 = 1353 kN from p.8 (other listed value 1094 kN / 112 t). operatingWeight_t not stated in brochure. Capacities in metric tons; radius from slewing centre; wind 9 m/s basis."
